\begin{note}
The \lstinline{@dataclass} decorator examines the class body,
and generates \lstinline{__init__}, \lstinline{__repr__}, and \lstinline{__eq__} methods
based on the field annotations.
With \lstinline{frozen=True}, it also generates \lstinline{__hash__}.
With \lstinline{eq=True, frozen=False}, it sets \lstinline{__hash__ = None},
matching the behavior of hand-written \lstinline{__eq__} from the previous section.
\end{note}
